[00:09.40] Chorus:
[00:09.90] I'll still see you walking, silently
[00:14.85] Through the shadows in my mind
[00:19.88] A vision of your sweet blue eyes
[00:25.09] Creeps into my dreamful sleep at night
[00:29.85] You still haunt the deepness of my memories
[00:34.84] I guess you will throughout all time
[00:39.94] Little girl I still remember
[00:44.74] The very dress you wore on that day
[00:49.74] It was so soft, a shade of violet, Lord
[00:54.58] How it took my breath away
[00:59.94] As the sunshine of the morning
[01:04.81] Broke across your golden hair
[01:09.17] How I wished to hold you tightly, Lord
[01:14.62] But I was shy and did not dare
[01:18.62] Chorus:
[01:19.34] I'll still see you walking, silently
[01:23.26] Through the shadows in my mind
[01:29.17] A vision of your sweet blue eyes
[01:34.79] Creeps into my dreamful sleep at night
[01:39.28] You still haunt the deepness of my memories
[01:44.22] I guess you will throughout all time
[01:48.72] --- Instrumental ---
[02:19.18] Many nights I've sat and wondered
[02:24.08] If you might be somebody's wife
[02:29.10] But if you're not, I'd long to see you
[02:33.50] If just to tell you how I've pined
[02:38.96] I've been known to ask a stranger
[02:43.73] That I thought might just pass your way
[02:49.26] If they would tell you of these feelings
[02:53.52] That we might meet again someday
[02:57.95] Chorus:
[02:58.75] I'll still see you walking, silently
[03:03.78] Through the shadows in my mind
[03:08.67] A vision of your sweet blue eyes
[03:13.96] Creeps into my dreamful sleep at night
[03:18.57] You still haunt the deepness of my memories
[03:23.46] I guess you will throughout all time
[03:28.22] You still haunt the deepness of my memories
[03:33.31] I guess you will throughout all time
[03:38.25] I guess you will throughout all time...
